# Security Kuralları

Önce oku: `docs/11_SECURITY/SECURITY.md`, `docs/08_API/API_SPECIFICATION.md`

## Auth & Authorization

- JWT + refresh token rotation; OAuth2 (Google, Steam, Discord, Apple)
- RBAC: Guest, User, Premium, Developer, Studio, Moderator, Admin
- Password: min 12 chars, Argon2id

## Environment (`ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLES.md`)

- `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`; public mobile: `EXPO_PUBLIC_*`, admin: `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`
- Startup fails if required secret/URL missing; never commit `.env.local` / `.env.production`
- Rotation: JWT 90d, API keys/DB 180d, OAuth 365d

## API

- HTTPS only; Helmet, CORS, rate limiting, CSRF (web)
- Input validation + output sanitization
- Never commit secrets; env vars only

## Uploads (`STORAGE_ARCHITECTURE.md`)

- S3 / Cloudflare R2; CDN via Cloudflare; Sharp + FFmpeg + ClamAV
- Pipeline: auth → virus scan → optimize → storage → CDN invalidation
- UUID filenames only; signed URLs for private media (15min default)
- Size limits: avatar 10MB, post/review 25MB, video 500MB
- Forbidden: executables, scripts, APK/IPA, unknown binaries

## Compliance

GDPR/KVKK ready; consent management, data export/deletion

## Monitoring

Failed login alerts, brute force protection, audit logs
